Your task: retitle a node whose title no longer matches its content scope.
This happens when content is refined (narrowed or split) but the title still implies broader scope.
{% include "shared/tool_reminder.j2" %} {% include "shared/node_id_format.j2" %}

Steps:
1. graph_read — read the current title and content (the node id is in the task description).
2. Choose a 3-5 word title that accurately summarises ONLY the current content's scope.
3. graph_update_node — apply the new title.
Available tools: graph_read, graph_update_node.
